vered the money"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.77, 0.89, 1.21, 1.71, 2.09, 2.38, 2.67, 3.36, 3.79, 4.08, 4.6]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its General Counsel contacted the former employee.", "t0": 19.32, "t1": 21.95, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "management", "kicker": "BART recovered the money", "text": "General Counsel", "mark": "General"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.52, 1.0, 1.52, 1.63, 1.97]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The employee agreed to repay BART and paid in full.", "t0": 22.07, "t1": 25.02, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "management", "layout": "table", "heading": "Full repayment", "context": "January 2026 management response", "rows": [{"label": "Time theft", "value": "$993.17"}, {"label": "Restitution", "value": "Paid in full"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.53, 0.9, 1.02, 1.43, 1.87, 2.06, 2.34, 2.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Three other complaints had different outcomes.", "t0": 25.14, "t1": 27.59, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "Three other complaints had different outcomes", "text": "Three other complaints", "mark": "Three"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.51, 1.13, 1.28, 1.65]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Webclock could not show where someone clocked out.", "t0": 27.71, "t1": 30.13, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "Three other complaints had different outcomes", "text": "Remote clock-out", "mark": "Remote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.62, 0.79, 1.01, 1.18, 1.53, 1.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Flexible work arrangements prevented a conclusion about early departures.", "t0": 30.25, "t1": 34.11, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Early departures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.72, 1.28, 1.75, 1.85, 2.47, 2.73, 3.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The overtime kickback complaint relied on hearsay.", "t0": 34.23, "t1": 36.94, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "Three other complaints had different outcomes", "text": "No direct knowledge", "mark": "No"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.61, 1.08, 1.55, 1.88, 2.05]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "About 300 employees could use Webclock.", "t0": 37.16, "t1": 39.5, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "About 300", "label": "Webclock access review remained in progress"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.46, 0.79, 1.26, 1.5, 1.68]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In November, the review of that access was still in progress.", "t0": 39.62, "t1": 43.05, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "dashboard", "layout": "table", "heading": "Webclock access review", "context": "November 23 recommendation register", "rows": [{"label": "Access policy", "value": "In progress"}, {"label": "Management target", "value": "December 2026"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.81, 0.91, 1.21, 1.3, 1.5, 1.95, 2.11, 2.36, 2.54]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.17, "t1": 45.72, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.71, 0.92, 1.25, 1.37, 1.5, 1.82, 2.14]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "One employee clocked in for both employers", "b": "BART recovered the money", "o": "Webclock access review remained in progress"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "contrast"}